-der-koningen.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T11:04:00Z","review_batch":"nl005-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/129346/de-strijd-der-koningen.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","sha256":"3d43f0a8fdb2751bf713aed7fc4e6527d960b5a528b20ef95236ba1c46ef5ed7","fact":"Exact title/author/ISBN, physical format and language source reviewed; independent contradictions recorded"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000103345_De_strijd_der_koningen_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T10:56:45.814Z","sha256":"cc213b6cf32f6ff8f07cf9473b7c2e37a6498847abc6b4c6dd499bc9c3e06455","bytes":82479,"fact":"Same-edition source association and title/author artwork visually reviewed; not only HTTP200"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:121","key":{"work_id":924100121,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":924100121,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":921300020,"text":"Na de dood van koning Robert valt Westeros uiteen in rivaliserende kampen. Verschillende machthebbers maken aanspraak op de IJzeren Troon, terwijl de Lannisters hun positie in Koningslanding proberen te behouden. Vanuit het noorden trekt Robb Stark op en ook Stannis Baratheon bereidt zijn strijd voor. De verschillende perspectieven tonen hoe oorlog, familiebelangen en onzekere bondgenootschappen het leven binnen en buiten de grote adellijke huizen steeds verder ontwrichten.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/129346/de-strijd-der-koningen.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T11:04:00Z","review_batch":"nl005-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/129346/de-strijd-der-koningen.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Source content actually read; original Dutch synopsis, identity reviewed separately","sha256":"3d43f0a8fdb2751bf713aed7fc4e6527d960b5a52