met Hunt Athalar, een gevreesde huurmoordenaar. Hun onderzoek legt steeds meer verbanden bloot die verder reiken dan de oorspronkelijke misdaad en de verschillende belangen binnen de stad raken.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1810347/huis-van-aarde-bloed.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T11:04:00Z","review_batch":"nl005-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1810347/huis-van-aarde-bloed.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Source content actually read; original Dutch synopsis, identity reviewed separately","sha256":"c8b4f6d0e8f3d47c54067e39abd984011b26dbc167e4eed069b7c927cc994159"}]}}]'::jsonb;receipt jsonb;r jsonb;p jsonb;k jsonb;expected jsonb;prior jsonb;ids jsonb:='{}';kv record;i integer:=0;n integer;begin
